      en: ["The reef is primarily composed of calcareous algae and coral remains.", "It is part of the 'Prut Toltre' geological monument, unique to Eastern Europe.", "The formation dates back to the Middle Miocene era (Sarmatian stage).", "The cliffs rise to a relative height of more than 50 meters above the valley.", "The nearby village of Cobani is famous for its large population of white storks.", "The site supports rare xerophytic plant species typical of warmer climates."],
