      en: ["The total length of the Cogîlnic River is approximately 243 kilometers.", "About 125 kilometers of the river's course lies within Moldova.", "The river passes through the Moldovan towns of Hîncești and Cimișlia.", "It discharges into the Sasyk Lagoon in the Odesa region of Ukraine.", "The total drainage basin covers an area of roughly 3,910 square kilometers.", "The name Cogîlnic likely derives from a Turkic term meaning 'grass'."],
